<odoo>
    <record id="view_server_action_form_inherit_create_fields" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">ir.actions.server.form.inherit.create.fields</field>
        <field name="model">ir.actions.server</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="base.view_server_action_form" />
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//field[@name='link_field_id']" position="after">
                <field
                    name="field_default_value_ids"
                    invisible="state != 'object_create'"
                >
                    <list editable="bottom">
                        <field name="field_id" />
                        <field name="value" />
                    </list>
                </field>
                <div
                    class="alert alert-info o_form_info"
                    role="alert"
                    invisible="state != 'object_create'"
                >
                    <h3>How to write default values using Python expressions</h3>
                    <p
                    >You can use Python expressions to compute values dynamically based on the source record.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>object:</strong> the source record (e.g., <code
                        >object.name</code>, <code>object.user_id.id</code>)</li>
                        <li><strong>context_today():</strong> current date (e.g., <code
                        >context_today()</code>)</li>
                        <li><strong>relativedelta:</strong> to shift dates (e.g., <code
                        >context_today() + relativedelta(days=10)</code>)</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For Many2one fields, make sure to return the ID, e.g.:</p>
                    <code>object.user_id.id</code>

                    <h4>Examples</h4>
                    <p>
        1. Set name from the source record:<br />
        <code>'Lead for ' + object.name</code>
    </p>
                    <p>
        2. Set today's date:<br />
        <code>context_today()</code>
    </p>
                    <p>
        3. Set a future date (10 days from today):<br />
        <code>context_today() + relativedelta(days=10)</code>
    </p>
                    <p>
        4. Assign current user:<br />
        <code>object.user_id.id</code>
    </p>
                </div>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
